\n\nAlternatively, delete today's expenses (reset to 0 spent today). Then the toolbar fill is empty (all pale). Then type an amount with Food applied → fill should appear olive if the feature works. That's a clean test. Deleting my test expenses is cleanup too. Let's do that: delete the €1 and €0.5 Transport expenses.\n\nThis will restore today's spend to 0 and the daily remaining to €1.9 (wait, budget now EUR, total 100, spent yesterday 60; remaining 40 over 21 days = 1.9). Then type 0.5 with Food → fill should be olive; with Transport → orange.\n\nBut hold on: deleting both today's expenses leaves \"Today\" with no entries. Then applying a category can't recolor an actual spent portion; the preview could. Let's see.\n\nAlso this tests the delete+undo and restores precondition-ish data (except currency EUR). Then I'll revert currency to USD at the end.\n\nLet me delete the two today's expenses. First reveal the list: swipe down on handle."}
